# Auto Rank main cycle (crimes, GTA, booze, OC)
#
# Option A — Every 60 seconds via ticker script (run in background or systemd):
#   python scripts/cron-cycle-ticker.py
#   (Default 60s; set CRON_CYCLE_INTERVAL in env to change.)
#
# Option B — Every minute via crontab: use ONE of the lines below.
#   Replace YOUR_CRON_SECRET with the value from backend/.env (CRON_SECRET).

# Same host (backend on port 8000), every minute:
* * * * * curl -s -X POST -H "X-Cron-Secret: YOUR_CRON_SECRET" -H "Content-Type: application/json" http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auto-rank/cron

# Or if cron runs elsewhere, call your public URL (every minute):
# * * * * * curl -s -X POST -H "X-Cron-Secret: YOUR_CRON_SECRET" -H "Content-Type: application/json" https://mafiawars.co.uk/api/auto-rank/cron
